WEBVTT

00:10:29.041 --> 00:10:31.502
because their experiences
and the world around them

00:10:31.543 --> 00:10:32.753
is quite different.

00:10:32.795 --> 00:10:35.214
So I think that's definitely been one,

00:10:35.255 --> 00:10:39.677
and I will tell you,
it has involved a lot of --

00:10:39.718 --> 00:10:41.762
as an executive team
and leadership team --

00:10:41.804 --> 00:10:44.765
it's involved a lot of trying things,

00:10:44.807 --> 00:10:46.308
it not working,

00:10:46.350 --> 00:10:48.560
and changing them.

00:10:48.560 --> 00:10:51.063
And a great example is our Q and A.

00:10:51.105 --> 00:10:52.690
I feel like every leader I know

00:10:52.690 --> 00:10:55.025
has a perspective
on whether they do open Q and A

00:10:55.067 --> 00:10:57.277
or anonymous Q and A,
or real-time Q and A.

00:10:57.277 --> 00:11:00.364
We've changed our approach
there multiple times,